{
  "lang": "zh-Hant",
  "slug": "inventory",
  "source_sha256": "f23316574b3222ec2f9380f5e83d952bf13c1af2cb9c356a27c89d87f0442961",
  "title": "行囊",
  "nav_label": "行囊",
  "description": "每名PC都有的行囊附頁：整裝與負重規則、裝備格位、補給品與小件物品清單。",
  "sections": {
    "undefined": "未指定",
    "gear": "裝備",
    "possessions-items-loot": "財物、物品與戰利品",
    "other-things": "其他物件",
    "small-items": "小件物品",
    "prosperity": "繁榮度"
  },
  "body_html": "<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"inventory\">\n<p>當你 <strong><em>整裝</em></strong>時，在下方勾選若干 ◇，落在具體物品或「未指定」上。</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\">\n<li>若為 <strong>輕裝</strong> (<em>迅捷安靜</em>），至多勾 3 ◇</li>\n<li>若為 <strong>常裝</strong>，勾選 4-6 ◇</li>\n<li>若為 <strong>重裝</strong> (<em>吵鬧、遲緩、悶熱、易疲</em>），勾選 7-9 ◇</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"undefined\">未指定</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-undef\"><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-0\" title=\"標記 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-0\" aria-label=\"標記 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-1\" title=\"標記 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-1\" aria-label=\"標記 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-2\" title=\"標記 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-2\" aria-label=\"標記 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-3\" title=\"標記 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-3\" aria-label=\"標記 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-4\" title=\"標記 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-4\" aria-label=\"標記 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-5\" title=\"標記 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-5\" aria-label=\"標記 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-6\" title=\"標記 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-6\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-6\" aria-label=\"標記 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-7\" title=\"標記 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-7\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-7\" aria-label=\"標記 8\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-8\" title=\"標記 9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-8\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-8\" aria-label=\"標記 9\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>當你 <strong><em>有備無患</em></strong>時，將此處的一個標記移到下方某個具體的 ◇ 上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"gear\">裝備</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-supplies-0\"><span><strong>補給品</strong> （4+繁榮度 次 ○○○○ ○○）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>更多補給品</strong> （4+繁榮度 次 ○○○○ ○○）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>再多些補給品</strong> （4+繁榮度 次 ○○○○ ○○）</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\"><em>補給品可用於恢復、紮營，或額外備有 <em>小件</em> 物品。</em></p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-mess-kit-0\"><span><strong>炊具</strong> （需要火與水；能讓補給品更耐用）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-bedroll-0\"><span><strong>鋪蓋捲</strong> （紮營時額外恢復 1d6 HP）</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-blanket-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-blanket-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-blanket-0\"><span><strong>毯子</strong> (<em>保暖</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\"><span><strong>換洗衣物</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rope-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-rope-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-rope-0\"><span><strong>繩索</strong>，約25尺</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shovel-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shovel-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-shovel-0\"><span><strong>鏟子</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-1\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-sledge-0\"><span><strong>拖橇／擔架／曳架</strong>，可捲收</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\"><span><strong>雪鞋</strong></span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-torch-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-torch-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-torch-0\"><span><strong>火把</strong> （可燃約1小時； <em>觸及</em>, <em>範圍</em>, <em>危險</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\"><span><strong>油燈</strong> （○○○ 小時， <em>近戰</em>, <em>範圍</em>, <em>粗劣</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-oil-0\"><span><strong>備用燈油</strong> （○○○○○ 小時，供油燈／提燈用，無法作武器）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-1\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-firewood-0\"><span><strong>柴薪</strong> （足夠燒一整夜， <em>觸及</em>, <em>範圍</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-hatchet-0\"><span><strong>手斧</strong>，鐵製（<em>近身</em>, <em>投擲</em>，x 穿刺）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mallet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mallet-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-mallet-0\"><span><strong>木槌</strong>，鐵製或木製（<em>近身</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mattock-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mattock-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-mattock-0\"><span><strong>鶴嘴鋤</strong>，鐵製（<em>近戰</em>，x 穿刺， <em>血腥</em>, <em>笨拙</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-1\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-maul-0\"><span><strong>大錘</strong>，鐵製（<em>近戰</em>, <em>強力</em>, <em>笨拙</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-staff-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-staff-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-staff-0\"><span><strong>長杖</strong> (<em>近戰</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-spear-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-spear-0\"><span><strong>長矛</strong>，鐵製（<em>近戰</em>, <em>投擲</em>，x 穿刺）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-long-spear-0\"><span><strong>長柄矛</strong>，鐵製（<em>觸及</em>，x 穿刺）</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bow-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bow-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-bow-0\"><span><strong>弓與鐵箭</strong> (<em>近距</em>，x 穿刺，○ 箭矢將盡，○ 箭矢耗光）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\"><span><strong>備用箭矢</strong> （x 穿刺，○ 箭矢充足，○ 箭矢將盡，○ 箭矢耗光）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-javelins-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-javelins-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-javelins-0\"><span><strong>標槍</strong>，數支，鐵製（<em>投擲</em>，x 穿刺，+1 傷害，○ 耗光）</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-1\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-shield-0\"><span><strong>盾牌</strong> （+1 護甲；守護擲出7+時 +1 戒備）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-thick-hides-0\"><span><strong>厚獸皮</strong> （1 護甲， <em>保暖</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-cloak-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-cloak-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><label for=\"inv-cloak-0\"><span><strong>斗篷</strong> (<em>保暖</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"possessions-items-loot\">財物、物品與戰利品</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot0-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot0-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot0\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"物品\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot1-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot1-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot1\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"物品\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot2-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot2-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot2\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"物品\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot3-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot3-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot3\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"物品\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot4-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot4-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot4\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"物品\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot5-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot5-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot5\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"物品\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot6-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot6-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot6\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"物品\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot7-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot7-0\" aria-label=\"格位\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot7\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"物品\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-things\">其他物件</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">（牲口、成套工具、藏起的物品等）</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:other-things\" rows=\"2\" aria-label=\"其他物件\"></textarea></div>\n<h3 id=\"small-items\">小件物品</h3>\n<p>能裝進口袋、腰包或靴筒。當你 <strong><em>整裝</em></strong>時，在下方勾選等於 4+繁榮度 數目的 ☐。</p>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-small-undef\"><span class=\"track-label\">未指定</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-0\" title=\"標記 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" aria-label=\"標記 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-1\" title=\"標記 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" aria-label=\"標記 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-2\" title=\"標記 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" aria-label=\"標記 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-3\" title=\"標記 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" aria-label=\"標記 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-4\" title=\"標記 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" aria-label=\"標記 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-5\" title=\"標記 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" aria-label=\"標記 6\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>當你 <strong><em>有備無患</em></strong>時，將此處的一個標記移到下方物品上，或消耗補給品來多勾一個 ☐。</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list inv-small\">\n<li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-knife\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-knife\" data-check-id=\"inv-knife\"> <span><strong>小刀或匕首</strong>，鐵製（<em>近身</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-sling\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sling\" data-check-id=\"inv-sling\"> <span><strong>投石索</strong> (<em>近距</em>, <em>裝填</em>, <em>笨拙</em>，○ 彈藥將盡，○ 彈藥耗光）</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-rushlight\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rushlight\" data-check-id=\"inv-rushlight\"> <span><strong>燈芯草燭</strong> （可燃約15-30分鐘， <em>近身</em>, <em>粗劣</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-tinderbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-tinderbox\" data-check-id=\"inv-tinderbox\"> <span><strong>火絨盒</strong> (<em>遲緩</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-needle-thread\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-needle-thread\" data-check-id=\"inv-needle-thread\"> <span><strong>針線</strong></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-coppers\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-coppers\" data-check-id=\"inv-coppers\"> <span><strong>一把銅幣</strong></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-whisky\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-whisky\" data-check-id=\"inv-whisky\"> <span><strong>威士忌</strong>，一皮囊（○○ 次）</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-awl\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-awl\" data-check-id=\"inv-awl\"> <span>錐子</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-bowstring\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bowstring\" data-check-id=\"inv-bowstring\"> <span>弓弦</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-chalk\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-chalk\" data-check-id=\"inv-chalk\"> <span>粉筆</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-charcoal\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-charcoal\" data-check-id=\"inv-charcoal\"> <span>木炭</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-clay-jar\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-clay-jar\" data-check-id=\"inv-clay